{"addedOn":10,"avgRating":["fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o"],"breadcrumbsHtml":"<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117\">OpenEdge Development: ABL Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/ABL-Syntax-Reference.html\">ABL Syntax Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<span class=\"active\">PUT-INT64 statement</span>\n","class":"manual","created":1470,"dislikeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/dislike/310420","html":"<article class=\"hascomments\" data-page=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/PUT-INT64-statement.html\" id=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/PUT-INT64-statement.html\"><main role=\"main\"><article aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\" class=\"dita\" id=\"PUT-INT64-statement\" role=\"article\">\n  <h1 class=\"title topictitle1 reference\" id=\"ariaid-title1\">PUT-INT64 statement</h1>\n  \n  <div class=\"body refbody\">\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"PUT-INT64-statement__section_N10024_N10021_N10001\">\n      <p class=\"p\">Stores the signed 64-bit value of an INT64\nor INTEGER expression at the specified memory location as an INT64\ndata type.</p>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"PUT-INT64-statement__syntax_GC1A1222701068\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d360364e96\">Syntax</h2>\n      \n      <table class=\"table frame-all\" id=\"PUT-INT64-statement__idGDO2SE2675064\"><caption></caption><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%\" /></colgroup><tbody class=\"tbody\">\n            <tr class=\"row rowsep-0\">\n              <td class=\"entry colsep-1 rowsep-1\">\n                <pre class=\"pre codeblock\"><code>PUT-INT64 ( <var class=\"keyword varname\">destination</var> , <var class=\"keyword varname\">position</var> ) = <var class=\"keyword varname\">expression</var></code></pre>\n              </td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody></table>\n      <dl class=\"dl parml\">\n        \n          <dt class=\"dt pt dlterm\">\n            <var class=\"keyword varname\">destination</var>\n          </dt>\n          <dd class=\"dd pd\">A variable of type RAW or MEMPTR. If <var class=\"keyword varname\">destination</var> is\nthe Unknown value (<code class=\"ph codeph\">?</code>), it remains the Unknown value (<code class=\"ph codeph\">?</code>).\nIf <var class=\"keyword varname\">destination</var> is a MEMPTR and its region in\nnot allocated (by a SET-SIZE statement or by a Windows dynamic link\nlibrary (DLL) or UNIX shared library routine), the AVM generates\na run-time error.</dd>\n        \n        \n          <dt class=\"dt pt dlterm\">\n            <var class=\"keyword varname\">position</var>\n          </dt>\n          <dd class=\"dd pd\">An integer value greater than 0 that indicates the byte position where the AVM stores\n              <var class=\"keyword varname\">expression</var>. If <var class=\"keyword varname\">position</var> is less than 1, the AVM\n            generates a run-time error. <p class=\"p\">For a RAW <var class=\"keyword varname\">destination</var>, if\n                <var class=\"keyword varname\">position</var> is greater than the length of\n                <var class=\"keyword varname\">destination</var>, the AVM increases the length of\n                <var class=\"keyword varname\">destination</var> to <var class=\"keyword varname\">position</var> plus the remaining\n              bytes needed to store <var class=\"keyword varname\">expression</var>. The gap between the original\n                <var class=\"keyword varname\">destination</var> length and <var class=\"keyword varname\">position</var> is padded with\n              null bytes. </p><p class=\"p\">For a MEMPTR <var class=\"keyword varname\">destination</var>, if\n                <var class=\"keyword varname\">position</var> is greater than the length of\n                <var class=\"keyword varname\">destination</var> or does not leave sufficient room to store\n                <var class=\"keyword varname\">expression</var>, the AVM generates a run-time error.</p></dd>\n        \n        \n          <dt class=\"dt pt dlterm\">\n            <var class=\"keyword varname\">expression</var>\n          </dt>\n          <dd class=\"dd pd\">The integer value of a constant, field, variable, function,\nor expression.</dd>\n        \n      </dl>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"PUT-INT64-statement__example_GC1A1242701098\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d360364e228\">Example</h2>\n      \n      <p class=\"p\">See\nthe example in the GET-INT64 function section.</p>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"PUT-INT64-statement__see-also_GC1A1252701102\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d360364e237\">See also</h2>\n      \n      <p class=\"p\">\n        <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"GET-INT64-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/GET-INT64-function.html\">GET-INT64 function</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"INT64-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/INT64-function.html\">INT64 function</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"PUT-LONG-statement.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/PUT-LONG-statement.html\">PUT-LONG statement</a></p>\n    </section>\n  </div>\n<nav role=\"navigation\"><div class=\"familylinks\"><div class=\"previouslink\"><strong>Previous topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"PUT-FLOAT-statement.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/PUT-FLOAT-statement.html\">PUT-FLOAT statement</a></div><div class=\"nextlink\"><strong>Next topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"PUT-KEY-VALUE-statement.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/PUT-KEY-VALUE-statement.html\">PUT-KEY-VALUE statement</a></div></div></nav><nav class=\"related-links\" role=\"navigation\"></nav></article></main></article>\n","isWatched":false,"labelText":"Product; Product > OpenEdge; Product > OpenEdge > Version 11.7; Format; Format > Documentation","likes":0,"likeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/like/310420","myDocsURL":null,"numOfPageViews":0,"numOfRatingsText":"<span>0 Ratings","revised":1318,"showWatch":false,"topicMeta":[["bookowner","oe11docs"],["bookrights","oe11docs"],["bundle","openedge-abl-reference-117"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product/product_openedge"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product/product_openedge/product_openedge_117"],["data","OEInformationHub/format"],["data","OEInformationHub/format/format_documentation"],["organization","oe11docs"]],"topicTitle":"PUT-INT64 statement","topicurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/PUT-INT64-statement.html","type":"Manual"}